<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Etude: Piano Cover Generation with a Three-Stage Approach — Extract, strucTUralize, and DEcode</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">1<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">st</sup> Tse-Yang Chen
